    "description": "<p>The character invokes this Charm in response to an attack. The attack must not be unexpected, and the character must have a weapon in hand. This Charm is a parry that perfectly defends against any attack, even if it is unblockable.</p><p>Mundane weapons can break when used with this Charm. If the character uses this Charm and a mundane weapon to block an attack that inflicts at least 25L raw damage before soak, the weapon breaks (though it still successfully parries).</p><p>This Charm has one of the Four Flaws of Invulnerability (see boxed text) common to all Solar perfect defenses.</p>",
